  aciklama:
  - "\u0130yi olmamana \xFCz\xFCld\xFCm. Sebebini sorsam ay\u0131p olur mu?"
  - "K\xF6t\xFC olmana \xFCz\xFCld\xFCm. Nedenini \xF6\u011Frenmemin bir sak\u0131ncas\u0131
    var m\u0131?"
  - "\xDCz\xFCld\xFCm b\xF6yle olmana. Sebebi benimle payla\u015F\u0131r m\u0131s\u0131n?"
  - "K\xF6t\xFC olmana \xFCz\xFCld\xFCm. Nedenini payla\u015Fmak ister misin benimle?"
  - "Aaa, neden k\xF6t\xFCs\xFCn?"
  - "Neden iyi de\u011Filsin?"
  - "Yapma ya, neden iyi de\u011Filsin?"
  - "Hay\u0131rd\u0131r, niye k\xF6t\xFCs\xFCn?"
  - "Hay\u0131rd\u0131r in\u015Fallah... Neden iyi de\u011Filsin?"
